{"id":"u-8550f72f-d72d-4c7b-b66f-4fd59bb2a7d6","src":"community","title":"Hybrid Athletics (on site)","author":"Caz","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/BxaFQS-hybrid-athletics","desc":"a program I created to run alongside my current body building split. Since I cannot go to a commercial gym everyday due to my job I have to accommodate with a gym that is less equipped. \n\nThis split is meant to improve my general fitness and health in a way that will supplement my main split. \n\nA- Plyometrics, trains my body to recruit the most power in my muscles in a short window of time \nB- Isometrics, trains my body to be able to control and balance in new ROMS’s\nC- Cardio since I gotta do it someday \nD- Recovery and mobility, to unlock more ROM. \n\nThis should make days where I go to a full gym easier, and all other facets of life, like being at my job and allat. \n\nGive it a try alyx if you’re reading and you can finally see what being optimal is like","level":["Beginner"],"goals":["Athletics","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":30,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-25T11:31:11.208Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["A] Plyometrics/ Explosiveness","B] Isometric Strength/ Control","C] ardio","D] ROM/ Recovery"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Broad Jump","sets":[{"r":3,"x":3}]},{"n":"Skater Hop","sets":[{"r":3,"x":6}],"note":"1L leg, 1R leg, 3 totals sets."},{"n":"Plyo Push-up","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Jump Squat","sets":[{"lo":3,"hi":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Lunge (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":4}],"note":"1 Set per side. 2 total sets for both legs."}]},{"ex":[{"n":"RFESS Iso Hold","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":4}]},{"n":"Single Leg Multidimensional Reach","sets":[{"r":6,"x":4}]},{"n":"Copenhagen Plank","sets":[{"sec":60,"x":4}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":3}]},{"ss":[{"n":"Suitcase Carry","sets":[{"sec":30,"secHi":60,"rpe":8,"x":4}],"note